{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2022-06-14 16:15:00', 'title': 'PPG SELLS TRAFFIC EQUIPMENT MANUFACTURER EBERLE DESIGN, INC.', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PPG (NYSE:PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE DIVESTITURE OF EBERLE DESIGN, INC. (EDI) TO VANCE STREET CAPITAL. TERMS OF THE TRANSACTION WERE NOT DISCLOSED. EDI IS A LEADING MANUFACTURER OF ELECTRONIC CONTROL SYSTEM COMPONENTS USED FOR MANAGING TRAFFIC SAFETY AND DETECTING VEHICLES AT INTERSECTIONS, AND FOR PARKING AND ACCESS, RAIL, AND EMERGENCY VEHICLE APPLICATIONS. THE COMPANY HAS APPROXIMATELY 150 EMPLOYEES AND OPERATES FROM A SINGLE LOCATION IN PHOEN'}